  "master": "E:\\pd-media\\episodes\\PD-2026-075-lahaina\\06_voice\\master\\short300_vc_master_en_us_v002.mp3",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "L1",
      "chunk_id": "L1",
      "delivery": "intense",
      "text": "The version of this story that most people carry is wrong, and the record says so directly.",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.876,
      "seconds": 4.876,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:313126e3cfac52615405f988d475693cfa7ff8b71b00785bb73eb9271c8d3061"
    },
    {
      "id": "L2",
      "chunk_id": "L2",
      "delivery": "building",
      "text": "The common account is that the power failed, the pumps stopped, and the hydrants went dry.",
      "start": 5.096,
      "end": 10.204,
      "seconds": 5.108,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:5f5eb1005c3fda22c0a7b67e6f8e1aa7191169d18fe3ef254d39b02141bd20e8"
    },
    {
      "id": "L3",
      "chunk_id": "L3",
      "delivery": "building",
      "text": "Both systems had uninterrupted electrical power during the August twenty twenty-three fires, and produced water at capacity for the duration of the fire.",
      "start": 10.424,
      "end": 18.04,
      "seconds": 7.616,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:8be0b829fd488c94fffbf954ba9a826fbaff8390402ab55e05f07056aa2740fb"
    },
    {
      "id": "L4",
      "chunk_id": "L4",
      "delivery": "intense",
      "text": "Uninterrupted power. Full capacity. For the duration.",
      "start": 18.26,
      "end": 21.279,
      "seconds": 3.019,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:b4bfd8dbf5639bafd74384473256470591a423ff43c90c191f5c9a09f61a4a2a"
    },
    {
      "id": "L5",
      "chunk_id": "L5",
      "delivery": "building",
      "text": "What actually happened to the pressure is the twenty-fourth finding, and it is worse, because nothing failed.",
      "start": 21.499,
      "end": 27.629,
      "seconds": 6.13,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:6c58c22b250f4a57313dd0ae6521669249375fab7597431323aeb2d7999c3457"
    },
    {
      "id": "L6",
      "chunk_id": "L6",
      "delivery": "calm",
      "text": "As structures burned, the household plumbing inside them failed, so that water flowed freely from more and more structures, and the pressure and flow in the fire area fell.",
      "start": 27.849,
      "end": 37.601,
      "seconds": 9.752,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:6b2eb961ceb1f43a8f56aafc2afe9e3a4b3dbadd22c0e8e6a78b16f9fe136711"
    },
    {
      "id": "L7",
      "chunk_id": "L7",
      "delivery": "intense",
      "text": "Every house that burned became an open tap. The system was not losing water because it was broken. It was losing water because it was working, into a thousand holes.",
      "start": 37.821,
      "end": 46.877,
      "seconds": 9.056,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:6001da87167246b103e19cf98a7074d9f8edc4bbefe38e74b9a0e233b8eabedd"
    },
    {
      "id": "L8",
      "chunk_id": "L8",
      "delivery": "calm",
      "text": "A town's water system is built to supply houses and to fight house fires. It is not built to fight the town.",
      "start": 47.097,
      "end": 53.227,
      "seconds": 6.13,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:6b55571a01b5f6b3ef965ead06bf13d7298dc0799821ed88df0bb41fb53b9545"
    }
  ]
}
